### Store Location API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@userAuthToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_TOKEN
@adminAuthToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN
@contentType = application/json

### Get enabled store locations (requires auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/store-locations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAuthToken}}

### Get enabled store locations (same as above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/store-locations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAuthToken}}

### Get store locations (deprecated query includeDisabled no longer supported)
GET {{baseUrl}}/store-locations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAuthToken}}

### Get store location by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/store-locations/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAuthToken}}

### Get store location by address code
GET {{baseUrl}}/store-locations/address/NYC001
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAuthToken}}

### Create a new store location (requires authentication)
POST {{baseUrl}}/store-locations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuthToken}}

{
    "addressCode": "NYC001",
    "name": "New York Central Store",
    "disabled": false
}

### Update store location (requires authentication)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/store-locations/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuthToken}}

{
    "name": "Updated Store Name",
    "disabled": false
}

### Delete store location (soft delete - requires authentication)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/store-locations/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuthToken}}
